// Where Hakuro's jacket's body is on its chart (engine::chart::Cover): a bit a place, set where
// it is. Written by the forms tool from where rays from the body's line met his sampled jacket,
// which is gone (rywible/wrela#438 is the last revision that holds it and the tool as it wrote
// this): kept as it is, for the jacket's neck and where its body stops under its shoulders. Its
// front, its armholes and its hem are cut by rule now (`hakuro::opening`, `hakuro::armhole`,
// `hakuro::COAT_SEAM`), and its collar and its shoulders have no cover: their edges are rules
// too (`hakuro::collar_top`, `hakuro::armhole_edge`). A cover made again is written from marks
// with `engine::chart::cover_source`.

use engine::chart::Cover

